# Normalize line endings to LF on every platform. Without this, Windows
# checkouts convert source files to CRLF and `zig fmt --check` reports them as
# non-conforming. Binary assets are marked so git never touches their bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
